# Week8 Final Set of Project

Goal

Bring everything together into one deployable project.

Topics to Learn
	•	End-to-end architecture with IaC, CI/CD, Containers, and Monitoring.
	•	Documentation, diagrams, cost optimization, and security posture.
	•	Resume and GitHub portfolio presentation.

Practice Resources

https://cloudresumechallenge.dev/docs/the-challenge/aws/
https://app.diagrams.net/
https://github.com/othneildrew/Best-README-Template

What Won’t Work

Copying random GitHub projects.
Your project should tell a story — problem, design, deployment, and outcome.